{
  "name": "SEC EDGAR 8-K, 10-K & Form 4 Insider Trades Executive Monitor & Digest (Vesper Labs)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Real-Time SEC EDGAR Filings, Form 4 Insider Trades & XBRL Digest\n**What this template automates:**\n1. Polls official US SEC EDGAR filings (`10-K`, `10-Q`, `8-K`, `Form 4`) and audited XBRL financials via `vesper26/sec-edgar-filings-mcp-server`.\n2. Deduplicates accession numbers across runs so you only alert on **newly filed** disclosures.\n3. Routes **Material Events / Insider Trades (`8-K` & `Form 4`)** immediately to Slack while archiving all `10-K`/`10-Q`/financial snapshots to Google Sheets.\n\n**1-Minute Setup:**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN>`) on node `2`.\n2. Edit `1. Workflow Config` with your ticker watchlist (`NVDA`, `MSFT`, `AAPL`, `CIEN`).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "s3-01-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup & Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stage 1: SEC EDGAR Poll & Accession Deduplication\nQueries `data.sec.gov` + XBRL `CompanyFacts` and suppresses previously seen accession numbers.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s3-02-stage1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Stage 2: XBRL Formatting, Priority Routing & Archive\nFormats USD billions/millions, routes urgent `Form 4` & `8-K` alerts to Slack, and logs every filing to Google Sheets.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "s3-03-stage2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Stage 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1360,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "n3-01-schedule",
      "name": "Every 6 Hours Market Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        120,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "n3-02-manual",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-tickers",
              "name": "tickersCsv",
              "value": "NVDA,MSFT,AAPL,CIEN",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-slack",
              "name": "slackChannel",
              "value": "#sec-filings-alerts",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n3-03-config",
      "name": "1. Workflow Config (Watchlist)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        380,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/vesper26~sec-edgar-filings-mcp-server/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ tickers: $json.tickersCsv.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean), formsFilter: ['10-K', '10-Q', '8-K', '4'], includeFinancials: true, maxFilingsPerCompany: 5 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "n3-04-sec",
      "name": "2. Fetch SEC Filings & XBRL (vesper26)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        320
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('1. Workflow Config (Watchlist)').item.json.slackChannel }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=:warning: *SEC EDGAR Monitor Error* — Check your Apify credential. Error: {{ $json.message || 'Request failed' }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "n3-05-errslack",
      "name": "Alert Admin on SEC Fetch Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Deduplicate SEC accession numbers & format XBRL numbers cleanly\nconst staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nstaticData.seenAccessions = staticData.seenAccessions || [];\nconst seen = new Set(staticData.seenAccessions);\n\nconst fmtUsd = (n) => {\n  if (typeof n !== 'number') return 'N/A';\n  if (Math.abs(n) >= 1e9) return '$' + (n / 1e9).toFixed(2) + 'B';\n  if (Math.abs(n) >= 1e6) return '$' + (n / 1e6).toFixed(1) + 'M';\n  return '$' + n.toLocaleString();\n};\n\nconst out = [];\nconst newlySeen = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const f = item.json;\n  const key = f.accessionNumber || `${f.ticker}-${f.form}-${f.filingDate}`;\n  if (seen.has(key)) continue;\n  newlySeen.push(key);\n  const fin = f.xbrlFinancialSnapshot || {};\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      accessionNumber: key,\n      ticker: f.ticker,\n      companyName: f.companyName,\n      form: f.form,\n      filingDate: f.filingDate,\n      filingUrl: f.filingUrl,\n      latestRevenue: fmtUsd(fin.revenueUsd),\n      latestNetIncome: fmtUsd(fin.netIncomeUsd),\n      latestCash: fmtUsd(fin.cashUsd),\n      isMaterialOrInsider: ['4', '8-K'].includes(String(f.form).toUpperCase()),\n      alertHeadline: `[${f.ticker}] New SEC Form ${f.form} (${f.filingDate}) — Rev: ${fmtUsd(fin.revenueUsd)}, Cash: ${fmtUsd(fin.cashUsd)}`\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nstaticData.seenAccessions = [...staticData.seenAccessions, ...newlySeen].slice(-1000);\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "n3-06-format",
      "name": "3. Deduplicate & Format XBRL Cards",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-sec-new",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.accessionNumber }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n3-07-if-new",
      "name": "4. New SEC Filing Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
